# Generated files
app/src/main/java/com/rishaanlabs/ros/data/local/RosDatabase_Impl*

# app/schemas/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Room exports only the current version, so a migration
# from N to N+1 has no way to know what N looked like unless N's schema is in the repository. It
# also makes a schema change show up as a diff in review, which is the only place anyone will
# notice one.

